This work consists of the file njit_thesis.cls.

The other files distributed with it (the starter document in the main
folder, the sample dissertation in sample/, the njit-*.bbx and njit-*.cbx
citation styles, readme.md, and the images in Graphics/ and
sample/Graphics/) are examples meant to be copied and changed. You may use
them, with or without changes, for your own thesis or dissertation, or for
